{"parentUuid":"2ab6ddee-e3a7-4d51-b400-f9c1177971c6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01NEUhmszqUkKingX9qrv1EU","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"2121c0f0-ee17-446d-9ee9-d2e18212e6e3","timestamp":"2026-10-10T19:38:43.152Z","session_id":"53e0d48f-0e86-4176-8390-70cad3fe3f46","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026/web","sessionId":"7fd52f13-5d0c-4e7f-8ec6-8a947b2499a1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"federated-petting-ripple"}
{"parentUuid":"2121c0f0-ee17-446d-9ee9-d2e18212e6e3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfu831gNhXzvAGABdEVaV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The list now has competitors and trends, a wishlist, drag-to-prioritise and compact rows with a details icon. I clicked through the whole flow in a headless browser with no errors, and the architecture diagram is updated. Reload **http://localhost:3000/dashboard/eu/1-series** to see it.\n\n**Competitors & trends**\n- A research agent found 32 signals, each linked to its source: 17 features people like in competitors (Mercedes, Genesis, Lexus, NIO, Xiaomi, Maextro…) and 15 trends.\n- Strongest examples:\n  - Euro NCAP 2026 rewards physical buttons again.\n  - In China, the Maextro S800 outsold the 7 Series in Jan–Apr 2026.\n  - 43% of US buyers want hands-free highway driving.\n- They sit in a panel above the requests. It shows the top 4 by default, with \"Show all\".\n- Customer requests that match a signal are highlighted and carry a badge, e.g. \"Physical buttons are back\".\n- Click a signal's link icon to show only the matching requests. The \"Backed by market\" filter does the same for all signals at once.\n- **Caveat:** the agent took its facts from search-result text rather than opening each page. A few signals rest on older or second-hand sources; I can list them.\n\n**Wishlist**\n- The star on any competitor feature or trend adds it to your wishlist.\n- Wishlist items go into the profiles whose theme fits: Tech-forward takes Digital and Powertrain items, Comfort & craft takes Interior and Exterior.\n- They're logged in Decisions and shown on the profile page.\n\n**Priority**\n- Drag a row by its handle to move it, or focus the handle and use ↑ ↓. The number on each row is its position, and there's a \"Reset priority\" button.\n- Profiles pick and list requirements in your order, show \"#1, #2…\", and score higher when they include your top priorities.\n\n**Smaller list**\n- Each request is now one compact row: category icon, title and urgency flames.\n- Small icon counts follow: mentions, wish it, hard to use, defect, and related options.\n- Then ✕ / ✓ and an **info icon** that opens a side panel with all the details. There's no dropdown any more.\n\n**Diagram:** `docs/architecture/07-pm-workflow.md` now includes the research agent, the feedback ↔ competitor/trend linking, wishlist, priority order and how they feed the build. It renders without errors.\n\nStill open:\n- **Markets:** the data has only Europe, China and USA, so do you want three markets (my recommendation) or the UK instead of Japan?\n- **Storage:** decisions, wishlist and priority are saved only in your browser for now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1167,"cache_read_input_tokens":258317,"output_tokens":899,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1167,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":899,"cache_read_input_tokens":258317,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1167,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1167},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfu831DqFhpLQ96mEF8gQ","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7a279575-533f-40af-a279-2bb38f2141e3","timestamp":"2026-10-10T19:38:43.150Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"53e0d48f-0e86-4176-8390-70cad3fe3f46","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026/web","sessionId":"7fd52f13-5d0c