`\",s,re.S).group(1)\nh=open('reports/pm-workflow.html').read()\nh=re.sub(r'<pre class=\"mermaid\">.*?</pre>', lambda _:'<pre class=\"mermaid\">'+m.replace(\"<\",\"&lt;\").replace(\">\",\"&gt;\")+'</pre>', h, flags=re.S)\nopen('reports/pm-workflow.html','w').write(h)\nEOF\nS=/Volumes/PJ/DevCache/claude-tmp/claude-501/-Volumes-PJ-peresjav-hackathons-ehl-final-minuch-2026/7fd52f13-5d0c-4e7f-8ec6-8a947b2499a1/scratchpad; node $S/cdp-shot.mjs \"file://$PWD/reports/pm-workflow.html\" $S/wf3.png 1300 2800 5000; cat >> prompts/24-signals-wishlist-priority.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Follow-ups (2026-10-10)\n> improve the design of this aprt, so images looks better [banner screenshot] imrpove also the moving of the list, maybe highlitinh when moving or something,.\n\n> profile page, should generate a pdf base on that information, also improve the estructure of profile page, and at the moment build profiles is done, the pepiline finish. and we see a dashbaord that has profiles, and we see the profiles generated, and another tab, analytics ti see how the perform on social media, and then analytics shows which profile is getting better track.\n\n**Result:** dark car banner (CarBanner) with stats; drag feedback (drop line, dimmed source, FLIP slide, flash); after Build → \"Pipeline complete\" Profiles dashboard with Profiles + Analytics tabs (simulated 14-day campaign, line chart, leader); restructured profile page + Download PDF (print → A4); diagram 07 updated.\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Update workflow diagram, validate render, log prompts","timeout":90000}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_015exDWkeWK6YdQ9U484FHEm":{"cwd":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026"}},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cfu8zM9BiPoC4sRwMuqec","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionSkill":"dataviz","type":"assistant","uuid":"f581cfe1-8637-472d-a69f-bbe072dd9934","timestamp":"2026-10-10T19:51:19.093Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session