{"parentUuid":"e8743747-bcec-41c2-8448-3e735ca0ce9f","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01Q59dD62xRnYJcg8fdwJFHF","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"5faec32d-0534-4356-b6d0-a34884916f94","timestamp":"2026-10-10T19:57:55.062Z","session_id":"53e0d48f-0e86-4176-8390-70cad3fe3f46","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026","sessionId":"7fd52f13-5d0c-4e7f-8ec6-8a947b2499a1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"federated-petting-ripple"}
{"parentUuid":"5faec32d-0534-4356-b6d0-a34884916f94","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfu9W9JPK95BR8mR4XbmQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The left sidebar is gone from the market page and now appears only after the profiles are built. The market page shows just the series choice, as new photo cards. Types and lint pass, and I checked both pages in a headless browser.\n\n**Market page** (http://localhost:3000/dashboard/us)\n- It shows only \"Which car are you planning?\" and three cards.\n- Each card has the full car photo with its model code (F70/G60/G70) on top and a navy panel below.\n- The panel holds the name and positioning, plus chips for comments in this market, requests and competitor/trend signals.\n- A \"No comments here yet\" warning appears where a market has none, and a \"Start analysis →\" button opens the pipeline.\n- I removed the old \"Market overview\" section (backlog numbers, top requirements, gaps) and deleted the two components behind it.\n\n**Sidebar after the build**\n- Once you click Build profiles, a left sidebar appears with four entries:\n  - **Profiles** (with the count)\n  - **Analytics** (a green dot once the social test has run)\n  - **Decisions** (your full log with reasons)\n  - **Edit requests** (back to the list to change decisions, then rebuild)\n- It replaces the Profiles/Analytics tabs from before.\n\n**Analytics fix:** the \"Tracking best\" card used a combined score, which made it look like it contradicted the chart. It now says it ranks by **social score** (half engagement rate, half share of positive reactions), and each profile card shows that score.\n\nI also updated `docs/architecture/06-web-app.md` with the new routes and pipeline components.\n\nThe two deleted component files show as deletions in git, so include them when you commit."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":399,"cache_read_input_tokens":392428,"output_tokens":539,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":399,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":539,"cache_read_input_tokens":392428,"cache_creation_input_tokens":399,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":399},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfu9W8u5BVyqgkMaiEfMh","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"865980d2-f6fa-4859-8525-c96556e7af46","timestamp":"2026-10-10T19:57:55.062Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"53e0d48f-0e86-4176-8390-70cad3fe3f46","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026","sessionId":"7fd52f13-5d0c-4e7f-8ec6-8a947b2499a1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"federated-petting-ripple"}
