{"parentUuid":"c9911374-af4a-4d51-aa02-cf0dc486836d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"630dc5bf-9911-4ee9-9df1-916188a3969f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"\n\n<pasted_content id=\"b3be\">\nOkay, but the problem is that the pipeline to analyze and create the profiles is working really nice. That should be keep it.\n\nBut then after the profiles are analyzed, then we should have a dashboard and this dashboard is showing the previous information of other profiles that was generated, everything, decisions that we take it.\n\nFor example, let's say I go right now to the dashboard and then I'm gonna see I don't know generations as a tab. And then I see also maybe or let's call it sessions. It's also possible, I don't know. And then when you clicked in there, then you see the previous generations of an specific profiles that were generated and then when we click in that in that generation then we see this dashboard that we see in the end of the different profiles and analytics and the rest of right now there is no real dashboard right now where I can you know see the previous work or previous generations.\n</pasted_content id=\"b3be\">\n"},"uuid":"69c61cb0-36d7-415b-89bf-3af517a90c4c","timestamp":"2026-10-10T20:13:58.915Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":37,"turnIndex":48},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026","sessionId":"7fd52f13-5d0c-4e7f-8ec6-8a947b2499a1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"federated-petting-ripple"}
