{"parentUuid":"400b6597-33b4-4ece-9b56-52dc0dfe5cfc","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"environment","snapshot":{"workingDirectory":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026","isWorktree":false,"isGitRepo":true,"additionalWorkingDirectories":[],"platform":"darwin","shell":"zsh","osVersion":"Darwin 27.2.0","scratchpadDirectory":"/Volumes/PJ/DevCache/claude-tmp/claude-501/-Volumes-PJ-peresjav-hackathons-ehl-final-minuch-2026/7fd52f13-5d0c-4e7f-8ec6-8a947b2499a1/scratchpad"},"changes":[{"field":"workingDirectory","from":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026/web"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"2c65e81d-666c-4804-86f0-57ed1616847b","timestamp":"2026-10-10T20:18:54.791Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n# Environment update\n - Primary working directory: /Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026 (was /Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026/web)\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"53e0d48f-0e86-4176-8390-70cad3fe3f46","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026","sessionId":"7fd52f13-5d0c-4e7f-8ec6-8a947b2499a1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"federated-petting-ripple"}
{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-10T20:19:03.574Z","sessionId":"7fd52f13-5d0c-4e7f-8ec6-8a947b2499a1","content":"keep only one button for new analysis [Image #15] \n\n<pasted_content id=\"b3be\">\nAlso in the decision, that has been made, should be:\n- record also the date\n- also the person who did this\n\nRight now we don't have a login system or something, but at least we should mention or have code the name of a person or something, and then also improve the landing page based on this new concept of workflow, which should improve the landing page, put also the real images of the car and also update the documentation of the architecture.\n</pasted_content id=\"b3be\">"}
{"parentUuid":"2c65e81d-666c-4804-86f0-57ed1616847b","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14961724 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"14b7ed61-276a-491a-9b4c-85405adfe887","timestamp":"2026-10-10T20:18:54.792Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14961724 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"53e0d48f-0e86-4176-8390-70cad3fe3f46","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026","sessionId":"7fd52f13-5d0c-4e7f-8ec6-8a947b2499a1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"federated-petting-ripple"}
{"parentUuid":"14b7ed61-276a-491a-9b4c-85405adfe887","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuB7VFGng4nqZdha47re","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"There's now a real dashboard with your earlier generations, the pipeline itself works as before, and the analysis steps use plain names instead of L1/L2/L3. I tested it end to end in a headless browser: building a profile opened its own generation page, `/dashboard` listed it, and reopening it worked. No errors, and types and lint pass.\n\n**The dashboard**\n- **`/dashboard`** opens on the **Generations** tab:\n  - Four numbers at the top: generations, car × market combinations, decisions logged, and the top-scoring profile so far.\n  - One card per earlier generation, showing the car photo, series and market, date, best profile and its score, kept/rejected/wishlist counts, and whether a social test was run. A delete button appears when you hover.\n- **New analysis** (tab, or the blue button in the top bar, at `/dashboard/new`) shows the globe → series → pipeline you already have.\n\n**After a build**\n- The pipeline saves the result as a **generation** and opens its own page:\n  - The car banner with the generation number and date, and the numbers of profiles, kept, rejected and wishlist items.\n  - A sidebar with **Profiles**, **Analytics** (social test) and **Decisions**. Profile pages open in the catalogue style with the PDF download.\n  - **Edit and rebuild** reopens the pipeline with that generation's decisions and priority already loaded. Building again creates a new generation, so earlier ones are never overwritten.\n- \"All generations\" takes you back to `/dashboard`.\n\n**Analysis wording** (the screen shown while analysing):\n- **BMW principles:** \"Retrieving the fundamentals and principles for the 7 Series\".\n- **Market evidence:**\n  - Reading customer comments and feature requests.\n  - Adding customer studies, sales and price-list options.\n  - The research agent scanning competitors and trends.\n- **Building the list:** grouping, linking to competitors and trends, sorting into categories, scoring urgency.\n- **No L3 in the analysis.** The social test appears only on the generation page, after the profiles exist.\n- I removed the codes in a few other places too: the build message, \"More evidence\", the reject reason \"Conflicts with a BMW principle\", and the \"why this profile\" lines.\n\nI also updated `docs/architecture/06-web-app.md` and `07-pm-workflow.md` with the dashboard and generations. Both render without errors.\n\nThings to know:\n- **Old sessions are gone:** the sessions page is replaced by Generations. Anything saved under the old \"Sessions\" name is still in your browser and shows up as generations.\n- **Browser-only for now:** generations are stored in this browser until Supabase is connected.\n- **Markets:** still waiting on your answer: three markets (Europe, China, USA), or the UK instead of Japan?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":446,"cache_read_input_tokens":505515,"output_tokens":924,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":446,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":924,"cache_read_input_tokens":505515,"cache_creation_input_tokens":446,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":446},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfuB7Umzz8HtJsEuNa78c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a3b96ab6-1ca8-48be-8c3f-94ef7c81c012","timestamp":"2026-10-10T20:19:04.279Z","advisorModel":"c