{"parentUuid":"ef77f5af-2930-4b5c-b1e6-7219329d9983","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b4173c08-11c5-405f-b5ca-e5748f05a2be","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019aDHFZLDUWr6C934gLqpTa","type":"tool_result","content":"hasName true\ntab ok\nlaunch ok\nhref /dashboard/generations#G-MV2UB4CN\nreopen title 5 Series · USA\nERRORS []","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"4b5015c8-53e5-4391-a933-6b75b0ef7d82","timestamp":"2026-10-10T20:21:59.034Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"hasName true\ntab ok\nlaunch ok\nhref /dashboard/generations#G-MV2UB4CN\nreopen title 5 Series · USA\nERRORS []","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026/docs/architecture/03-data-model.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":2,"oldLines":7,"newStart":2,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," The entities as built in `web/src/lib/pipeline/` (`types.ts`, `profiles.ts`, `sessions.ts`, `analytics.ts`, `series.ts`): series, markets, feature requests, option items, market signals, principles, decisions, generations, profiles, profile requirements and social-test campaigns."," ","-**Where it lives today.** Decisions and the priority order are stored per market + series in the browser (`localStorage`, keys `dixi:decisions:*` and `dixi:priority:*`); generations are stored there too (`dixi:sessions`, last 30). Series, markets, feature requests, option items, studies and sales come from `web/data-local/pipeline.json`, built locally by `scripts/build-pipeline-data.py` and git-ignored; without it (e.g. on Vercel) the app uses example data with the same shape. Principles live in `series.ts` and market signals in `market-signals.ts` (example content and public sources). **Planned:** the same entities as Supabase tables, with a real login for `by` / `created_by`.","+**Where it lives today.** Decisions and the priority order are stored per market + series in the browser (`localStorage`, keys `dixi:decisions:*` and `dixi:priority:*`); generations are stored there too (`dixi:sessions`, last 30). `by` and `created_by` come from a simple local \"who is deciding\" identity (`dixi:user`, `web/src/lib/user.ts`) until there is a login. Series, markets, feature requests, option items, studies and sales come from `web/data-local/pipeline.json`, built locally by `scripts/build-pipeline-data.py` and git-ignored; without it (e.g. on Vercel) the app uses example data with the same shape. Principles live in `series.ts` and market signals in `market-signals.ts` (example content and public sources). **Planned:** the same entities as Supabase tables, with a real login replacing the local identity."," "," ```mermaid"," erDiagram"]},{"oldStart":28,"oldLines":13,"newStart":28,"newLines":13,"lines":["   PROFILE ||--o| CAMPAIGN : \"tracked by\""," ","   SERIES { text id \"F70 | G60 | G70\" text name text slug text focus \"categories\" float l3_weight \"0.20 | 0.08 | 0.02\" }","-  MARKET { text id \"EU | US | CN | ALL\" text name }","+  MARKET { text id \"EU | US | CN | JP | ALL\" text name }","   PRINCIPLE { text id \"P1\" text series_id text text text owner }","   FEATURE_REQUEST { text id text series_id text title text category \"Exterior | Interior | Digital | Powertrain\" text summary int mentions jsonb by_market \"mentions per market\" jsonb types \"wants | difficult | defect\" jsonb sources text_array taxonomy \"BMW topics behind it\" text_array quotes \"local data only\" }","   OPTION_ITEM { text code text name float price_eur text group }","   MARKET_SIGNAL { text id text kind \"competitor | trend\" text title text competitor text category text detail text_array relates_to \"request titles\" text strength \"strong | emerging\" jsonb sources \"label + url\" }","-  DECISION { text request_id text title text action \"keep | reject | wish\" text reason \"required for reject\" text by \"PM name\" timestamptz at }","-  GENERATION { text id \"G-...\" timestamptz created_at text created_by \"planned\" text scope text series_id jsonb profiles jsonb decisions text_array priority_order jsonb campaigns \"null until tested\" }","+  DECISION { text request_id text title text action \"keep | reject | wish\" text reason \"required for reject\" text by \"name, local identity\" text role timestamptz at }","+  GENERATION { text id \"G-...\" timestamptz created_at text created_by text created_by_role text scope text series_id jsonb profiles jsonb decisions text_array priority_order jsonb campaigns \"null until tested\" }","   PROFILE { text id \"fix | tech | comfort\" text name text tagline text_array why float score_l1 float score_l2 float score_l3 \"null until tested\" float total }","   PROFILE_REQUIREMENT { text profile_id text request_id int priority \"PM position, 1 = first\" int scoped_mentions text draft_target \"SMART draft, PM edits\" }","   CAMPAIGN { text profile_id int days \"14\" int impressions float engagement float positive int shares float l3 \"0-1, simulated\" }"]}]},{"filePath":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026/docs/architecture/08-decision-audit.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":0,"oldLines":0,"newStart":1,"newLines":38,"lines":["+# Decision audit","+","+How one decision is made and audited, as built: the PM rejects a request → a reason is required → the decision is saved with who, when and why → it shows up in the decision log, the profile's decision trail and the PDF → the next generation keeps a snapshot. Keep and wishlist decisions follow the same path without the reason dialog.","+","+```mermaid","+sequenceDiagram","+  %% Decision audit trail in web/: Pipeline.tsx · RejectDialog.tsx · DecisionLog.tsx · Profiles.tsx · sessions.ts","+  %% Today: stored in this browser (localStorage); \"by\" = the local who-is-deciding identity (lib/user.ts). Planned: Supabase + login.","+  autonumber","+  actor PM as Product manager","+  participant UI as Pipeline list","+  participant RD as Reject dialog","+  participant ST as Decisions store","+  participant LOG as Decision log","+  participant GEN as Generation","+  participant PRF as Profile page + PDF","+","+  PM->>UI: Reject a feature request","+  UI->>RD: Open: why is it rejected?","+  alt no reason given","+    RD-->>PM: Confirm stays disabled (reason required)","+  else preset reason and/or own words","+    PM->>RD: e.g. \"Conflicts with a BMW principle: ...\"","+    RD->>ST: Decision {action: reject, reason, by: name, role, at: ISO time}","+    ST->>ST: Save per market + series","+    ST-->>LOG: Shown in the decision log (who · when · why)","+  end","+  PM->>UI: Keep others, drag priority, star wishlist items","+  UI->>ST: Decision {keep | wish, by, at}","+  PM->>UI: Build profiles","+  UI->>GEN: Save generation: profiles · decisions · priority order · created_at · created_by","+  Note over GEN: Snapshot: later edits do not change this generation","+  GEN->>PRF: Decision trail incl. reject reasons","+  PRF-->>PM: Download PDF with the same trail","+  PM->>GEN: Edit and rebuild","+  GEN->>UI: Decisions + priority loaded into the pipeline","+  UI->>GEN: Rebuild saves a new generation (the earlier one stays)","+```"]}],"created":true},{"filePath":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026/web/src/components/landing/Product.tsx","hunks":[{"oldStart":2,"oldLines":15,"newStart":2,"newLines":27,"lines":[" import path from \"node:path\";"," import Image from \"next/image\";"," import type { ReactNode } from \"react\";","-import { CircleHelp, GitBranch, UserCheck, type LucideIcon } from \"lucide-react\";","+import { FileDown, Radar, UserCheck, type LucideIcon } from \"lucide-react\";"," import { ProductMock } from \"./ProductMock\";"," "," const PHOTO_SRC = \"/images/product-dashboard.png\";"," "," const FEATURES: { title: string; body: string; Icon: LucideIcon }[] = [","-  { title: \"Lineage\", body: \"Follow any requirement back to the comments, studies and sales data behind it.\", Icon: GitBranch },","-  { title: \"Human in the loop\", body: \"The AI drafts. The product manager decides, and every decision carries a reason.\", Icon: UserCheck },","-  { title: \"What we don't know\", body: \"Missing markets, thin samples and conflicting signals are shown, not hidden.\", Icon: CircleHelp },","+  {","+    title: \"Traceable decisions\",","+    body: \"Every keep, reject and priority change records who made it, when and why. Rejects always carry a written reason.\",","+    Icon: UserCheck,","+  },","+  {","+    title: \"Competitors & trends with sources\",","+    body: \"A research agent finds what rivals offer and where the market is heading, and links every claim to its source.\",","+    Icon: Radar,","+  },","+  {","+    title: \"Generations you can reopen\",","+    body: \"Every build is saved. Reopen, compare or rebuild it, and export any profile as a catalogue-style PDF.\",","+    Icon: FileDown,","+  },"," ];"," "," function Quote({ children, className }: { children: ReactNode; className?: string }) {"]},{"oldStart":30,"oldLines":8,"newStart":42,"newLines":12,"lines":["       <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:py-28\">","         <p className=\"text-sm font-semibold text-brand\">Product</p>","         <h2 id=\"product-title\" className=\"mt-2 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink text-balance sm:text-5xl\">","-          Every requirement, <span className=\"text-brand\">traceable to its source.</span>","+          A car profile you can defend, <span className=\"text-brand\">down to the last decision.</span>","         </h2>","+        <p className=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">","+          Each build ends in two or three profiles laid out like a BMW option list: the cover, the requirements in your priority order,","+          why the agent chose them and the decisions behind them.","+        </p>"," ","         <div className=\"relative mt-12\">","           <div aria-hidden className=\"absolute -inset-x-6 -inset-y-8 -z-10 rounded-[32px] bg-[radial-gradient(70%_60%_at_50%_30%,var(--brand-soft),transparent_75%)]\" />"]},{"oldStart":47,"oldLines":7,"newStart":63,"newLines":7,"lines":["             </div>","             <div className=\"border-l-2 border-wait pl-6\">","               <Quote>","-                Know what you don&apos;t know. <span className=\"text-muted\">Gaps are flagged, never averaged away.</span>","+                Know what you don&apos;t know. <span className=\"text-muted\">Gaps and conflicts are shown, never averaged away.</span>","               </Quote>","             </div>","           </div>"]}]},{"filePath":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026/web/src/components/landing/ProductMock.tsx","hunks":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":115,"newStart":1,"newLines":176,"lines":["-/* Coded product preview: a small, static dashboard mock built from divs (sample content, not BMW data). */","-import { TriangleAlert, Check, Clock, GitBranch, Pencil, X } from \"lucide-react\";","+/* Coded product preview: a catalogue-style profile page next to the generations list.","+ * Sample content written for the landing page, not BMW data. */","+import Image from \"next/image\";","+import { Download, History, RotateCcw, Columns2, FolderOpen, X } from \"lucide-react\";","+import { CAR_IMAGES } from \"@/lib/car-images\";"," ","-type Status = \"kept\" | \"edited\" | \"postponed\" | \"rejected\";","+const COVER = CAR_IMAGES.G60.front;"," ","-const STATUS: Record<Status, { label: string; cls: string; Icon: typeof Check }> = {","-  kept: { label: \"Kept\", cls: \"bg-good-soft text-good\", Icon: Check },","-  edited: { label: \"Edited\", cls: \"bg-brand-soft text-brand-deep\", Icon: Pencil },","-  postponed: { label: \"Postponed\", cls: \"bg-wait-soft text-wait\", Icon: Clock },","-  rejected: { label: \"Rejected\", cls: \"bg-bad-soft text-bad\", Icon: X },","-};","+type Mark = \"this\" | \"other\" | \"none\";"," ","-const ROWS: { id: string; title: string; score: number; mix: [number, number, number]; status: Status }[] = [","-  { id: \"R-12\", title: \"Climate controls reachable without the touchscreen\", score: 86, mix: [20, 72, 8], status: \"kept\" },","-  { id: \"R-07\", title: \"Phone pairs in under 5 s on 95% of attempts\", score: 78, mix: [10, 80, 10], status: \"edited\" },","-  { id: \"R-21\", title: \"Body width fits standard Japanese car parks\", score: 74, mix: [70, 28, 2], status: \"kept\" },","-  { id: \"R-30\", title: \"Monthly over-the-air feature updates\", score: 61, mix: [5, 50, 45], status: \"postponed\" },","-  { id: \"R-33\", title: \"Paid subscription for heated seats\", score: 22, mix: [0, 60, 40], status: \"rejected\" },","+const MATRIX: { area: string; rows: { title: string; marks: [Mark, Mark, Mark] }[] }[] = [","+  {","+    area: \"Interior\",","+    rows: [","+      { title: \"Quieter cabin on the motorway\", marks: [\"this\", \"none\", \"other\"] },","+      { title: \"Rear seats that recline\", marks: [\"this\", \"none\", \"none\"] },","+    ],","+  },","+  {","+    area: \"Digital\",","+    rows: [","+      { title: \"Climate controls without the touchscreen\", marks: [\"this\", \"other\", \"none\"] },","+      { title: \"Phone pairs first time, every time\", marks: [\"none\", \"other\", \"other\"] },","+    ],","+  },"," ];"," ","-function Mix({ mix }: { mix: [number, number, number] }) {","-  return (","-    <div className=\"flex h-1.5 w-16 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-bg-soft\" aria-hidden>","-      <span className=\"bg-l1\" style={{ width: `${mix[0]}%` }} />","-      <span className=\"bg-l2\" style={{ width: `${mix[1]}%` }} />","-      <span className=\"bg-l3\" style={{ width: `${mix[2]}%` }} />","-    </div>","-  );","+const GENERATIONS = [","+  { id: \"Gen 3\", car: \"5 Series · Europe\", when: \"Today\", active: true },","+  { id: \"Gen 2\", car: \"5 Series · Europe\", when: \"2 days ago\" },","+  { id: \"Gen 1\", car: \"7 Series · China\", when: \"Last week\" },","+];","+","+function MarkCell({ m }: { m: Mark }) {","+  if (m === \"none\") return <span className=\"text-line\">–</span>;","+  return m === \"this\" ? <span className=\"text-ink\">■</span> : <span className=\"text-muted\">□</span>;"," }"," "," export function ProductMock() {","   return (","-    <div","-      role=\"img\"","-      aria-label=\"Preview of the Dixi dashboard: a list of draft requirements with scores, layer mix and the product manager's decision, a lineage trail and an evidence-gap warning.\"","+    <figure","+      aria-label=\"Preview of Dixi: a catalogue-style car profile with a requirements matrix, next to the list of saved generations and a decision with its reason.\"","       className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[18px] bg-surface shadow-float ring-1 ring-line\"","     >","       {/* window chrome */}","       <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-line bg-bg-soft px-4 py-2.5\">","-        <span className=\"size-2.5 rounded-full bg-line\" />","-        <span className=\"size-2.5 rounded-full bg-line\" />","-        <span className=\"size-2.5 rounded-full bg-line\" />","-        <span className=\"ml-3 truncate rounded-md bg-surface px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-muted ring-1 ring-line\">","-          dixi / 7 Series successor / requirements","+        <span aria-hidden className=\"size-2.5 rounded-full bg-line\" />","+        <span aria-hidden className=\"size-2.5 rounded-full bg-line\" />","+        <span aria-hidden className=\"size-2.5 rounded-full bg-line\" />","+        <span className=\"ml-3 min-w-0 truncate rounded-md bg-surface px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-muted ring-1 ring-line\">","+          dixi / generations / 5 Series · Europe / profile A","         </span>","       </div>"," ","-      <div className=\"grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_250px]\">","-        {/* requirements table */}","-        <div className=\"min-w-0 p-4 sm:p-5\">","-          <div className=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\">","-            <p className=\"text-sm fo