{"parentUuid":"85fd2842-abf2-4427-a30d-0f947b4b1dd6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14972217 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"a16f93db-8a5f-4810-8142-bed657731eaf","timestamp":"2026-10-10T20:22:09.558Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14972217 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"53e0d48f-0e86-4176-8390-70cad3fe3f46","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026","sessionId":"7fd52f13-5d0c-4e7f-8ec6-8a947b2499a1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"federated-petting-ripple"}
{"parentUuid":"a16f93db-8a5f-4810-8142-bed657731eaf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuBMpaGEfqf4NryKfMAJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two of the four changes are done; the landing page and the architecture docs are still with the two agents, and I'll report back when they finish.\n\n- **One \"New analysis\" button:** it now lives only in the top bar. I removed the Generations / New analysis switch from the dashboard; the New analysis page has a \"← Generations\" link back.\n- **Who decided, and when:** with no login yet, there's a simple \"who is deciding\" menu at the top right.\n  - **Picking a person:** you choose from four example team members (fictional: Lena Hoffmann, PM 1 Series; Marco Rossi, PM 5 Series; Sofia Chen, PM 7 Series; David Okafor, Head of product requirements) or type your own name and role. It's remembered in this browser, and Marco Rossi is the default.\n  - **What gets recorded:** every keep, reject and wishlist item saves the name, role, date and time.\n  - **Where it shows:** the decision log, next to each reject reason, in the profile's decision trail and in the PDF. The reject box also says \"Recorded as Marco Rossi · Product manager · 5 Series · now\" before you save.\n  - **Generations too:** each generation records who built it, shown on its card, in its header and on the profile cover.\n\nI tested a full run in a headless browser with no errors: the decisions were saved under Marco Rossi with date and time, and the generation shows \"Marco Rossi\". Types and lint pass."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":563,"cache_read_input_tokens":534222,"output_tokens":467,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":563,"ephe