he target pipeline.\n- `/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026/docs/architecture/01-system-overview.md`: new flowchart. Inputs → L1 principles and L2 evidence (the research agent feeds L2) → AI analysis → PM gate (keep, reject with reason, priority, wishlist) → decisions → three profiles → generations → profile page and PDF → L3 social test after profiles → edit and rebuild. The classDef colour conventions are kept.\n- `/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026/docs/architecture/03-data-model.md`: new ER diagram with the 12 entities you listed, plus a short note above it on what lives in localStorage today, what comes from local or example data, and what's planned for Supabase.\n- `/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026/docs/architecture/08-decision-audit.md` (new): a sequence diagram of reject → required reason → Decision {by, at, reason} → decision log → generation snapshot → profile decision trail and PDF → edit and rebuild saves a new generation.\n- `/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026/docs/architecture/02-feedback-loop.md`: a minimal fix, because it still treated L3 as social listening. The participant is renamed from \"L2 Evidence + L3 Signals\" to \"L2 Market evidence\", and the 7 Series social weight changes from 0.05 to 0.02.\n- 04 and 05 are unchanged.\n\n**Things to know**\n- **Identity code changed while I worked.** At first the code recorded `by` as the fixed string `\"You (PM)\"`. During the task, someone added `web/src/lib/user.ts`, a local \"who is deciding\" identity stored under `dixi:user`. Decisions now also store `role`, and generations store `createdBy` and `createdByRole`. I wrote 03 and 08 to match this newer code (`role` on DECISION, `created_by` and `created_by_role` on GENERATION).\n- **Two entries in 03 aren't stored.** `draft_target` on PROFILE_REQUIREMENT and urgency are worked out when a profile is shown, not saved, and the note under the diagram says so.\n- **Public safety.** The docs contain no dataset numbers, customer quotes or dataset IDs. The only numbers are code constants (urgency thresholds of 50 and 20, the L3 weights, and the 30-generation limit) and example content from `series.ts`.\n\nThe validation pages are in the scratchpad under `docval/`; `reports/pm-workflow.html` was not modified.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>103599</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>21</tool_uses><duration_ms>162289</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"},"uuid":"cd2ca0fa-df54-4cc1-8f56-7859faf27164","timestamp":"2026-10-10T20:22:53.968Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"task-notification","producer":"session-task","runId":"0mv2u96h5-2cdb779f"},"promptSource":"system","turnOrigin":"task_notification","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":38,"turnIndex":50},"queueSkipAttachments":true,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026","sessionId":"7fd52f13-5d0c-4e7f-8ec6-8a947b2499a1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"federated-petting-ripple"}
{"parentUuid":"cd2ca0fa-df54-4cc1-8f56-7859faf27164","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuBR7HS97ztfoEJNAUit","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The docs agent has finished; the landing-page agent is still running.\n\n**Docs updated** (all five changed diagrams render without errors):\n- **`README.md`:**\n  - The layers now read L1 BMW principles / L2 market evidence (including the research agent) / L3 social test after the profiles exist.\n  - The steps are now Choose → Analyse → Decide → Build → Remember, with a new short diagram.\n- **`docs/README.md`:** rewrote the core-ideas paragraph to cover generations, who and when on every decision, and today's browser storage with Supabase planned.\n- **`01-system-overview.md`:** a new end-to-end flow: research agent feeding market evidence → your decisions (keep / reject with reason / priority / wishlist) → profiles → generations → PDF → social test → edit and rebuild.\n- **`03-data-model.md`:** the real entities (generation, decision with person, role and time, competitor/trend signals, campaigns…), with a note on what's stored in the browser today and what's planned for Supabase.\n- **`08-decision-audit.md` (new):** how a reject is recorded with its required reason, person and time, and where it shows up: decision log, profile decision trail, PDF and generation snapshot.\n- **`02-feedback-loop.md`:** a small fix so it no longer treats L3 as social listening.\n\nThe docs contain no BMW numbers or customer quotes; the only numbers are app settings such as the urgency thresholds and the social-test weights.\n\nI'll report the landing page when its agent finishes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2382,"cache_read_input_tokens":534785,"output_tokens":507,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_