{"parentUuid":"d5c8fbf8-36d0-46e6-b6a6-fc5e5d43e05f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuC2GDRAwNrT7YCxxAAj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CLUNzTBPvQNg2sgPoqiWZs","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\ndef edit(p, pairs):\n    s=open(p).read()\n    for a,b in pairs:\n        assert a in s, (p,a[:70]); s=s.replace(a,b,1)\n    open(p,'w').write(s)\nedit('docs/architecture/03-data-model.md', [\n ('text role timestamptz at }','text role timestamptz at int mentions_at \"customers asking at decision time\" }'),\n ('  CAMPAIGN { text profile_id','  SCORING_SETTINGS { float w_demand float w_backing float w_fit float reject_penalty float keep_bonus int half_life_days float resurface_at bool hide_rejected text memory_scope \"market | all\" }\\n  CAMPAIGN { text profile_id'),\n ('  GENERATION ||--o{ CAMPAIGN : \"L3 social test\"','  GENERATION ||--o{ CAMPAIGN : \"L3 social test\"\\n  DECISION }o--o{ FEATURE_REQUEST : \"memory: lowers or lifts the score next time\"\\n  SCORING_SETTINGS ||--o{ FEATURE_REQUEST : \"ranks\"'),\n])\ns=open('docs/architecture/03-data-model.md').read()\ns=s.replace(\"Urgency is not stored:\",\"The Dixi score and decision memory are derived, not stored: see `09-scoring-and-memory.md`. Scoring settings live in localStorage (`dixi:scoring`) today.\\n\\nUrgency is not stored:\",1)\nopen('docs/architecture/03-data-model.md','w').write(s)\n\nedit('docs/architecture/07-pm-workflow.md', [\n ('''  link --> list[''','''  memory[(\"Decision memory<br/>past keeps / rejects + reasons<br/>from earlier generations\")] --> score[\"Dixi score<br/>demand · backing · principle fit<br/>past reject lowers it, unless demand grew\"]\n  settings[\"Settings<br/>scoring weights\"] --> score\n  link --> score --> list['''),\n ('  class mem,sess memory','  class mem,sess,memory memory'),\n ('class cluster,cat,urgency,link,build,profiles,done ai','class cluster,cat,urgency,link,build,profiles,done,score ai'),\n])\ns=open('docs/architecture/07-pm-workflow.md').read()\ns=s.replace('  sess -- \"open a generation\" --> dash','  sess -- \"open a generation\" --> dash\\n  sess -. \"feeds\" .-> memory',1)\nopen('docs/architecture/07-pm-workflow.md','w').write(s)\n\ns=open('docs/README.md').read()\nimport re\nrow='| [`09-scoring-and-memory.md`](architecture/09-scoring-and-memory.md) | The Dixi score (demand · market backing · principle fit) and decision memory: past rejects lower a request in later generations, fading with a half-life, unless demand grew (\"resurfaced\"); weights set in Dashboard → Settings; backend plan for the AI agent |\\n'\nlines=s.split('\\n')\ni=max(n for n,l in enumerate(lines) if l.startswith('| [`0'))\nlines.insert(i+1,row.rstrip('\\n'))\nopen('docs/README.md','w').write('\\n'.join(lines))\n\nedit('backend/README.md', [('''│   ├── scoring/             three-layer score: layer weights × source weights × market volume, principle gate''','''│   ├── scoring/             Dixi score (demand · market backing · principle fit) + decision memory (see docs/architecture/09)'''),\n ('''## Rules''','''## Decision memory (must-have for the agents)\nBefore the requirement agent proposes feature requests for a series and market, it calls `get_decision_memory(series, market)`:\npast decisions with who, when, reason and the customer count at the time. A request that was rejected before is **not proposed again**\nat full strength. It comes back only when demand has grown past the team's threshold (\"resurfaced\"), and then the agent quotes the old\nreason and the change. Matching uses the request title plus pgvector similarity, so a reworded request is still recognised. The rules and\nweights match `web/src/lib/pipeline/scoring.ts` and the team's settings (`scoring_settings` table).\n\n## Rules''')])\nEOF\ngrep -n \"09-scoring\" docs/README.md | head -2","description":"Update data model, workflow, docs index, backend plan"},"caller":{"type":"d