on.\n\n**Result:** lib/pipeline/scoring.ts (Dixi score = demand · market backing · principle fit; decision memory from earlier generations: reject penalty with half-life, \"resurfaced\" when demand grows ≥ threshold, keep bonus, hide option); decisions store mentionsAt; list ranked by score with Rejected / Resurfaced / Kept-before badges; /dashboard/settings with sliders + live example; matrix headers compacted (A/B/C); dev overlay checked across the full flow (no issues; settings Date.now fixed); ⓘ trace panel per requirement on the profile page. Docs: new 09-scoring-and-memory.md, 03/07/README/backend README updated.\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Update diagram, validate, log prompt","timeout":60000}},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CfuCPRQuSWJ9Xzek1u5gS","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"dbef4d81-c667-4f11-9d8e-294b571fb0f6","timestamp":"2026-10-10T20:35:52.877Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"53e0d48f-0e86-4176-8390-70cad3fe3f46","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026/web","sessionId":"7fd52f13-5d0c-4e7f-8ec6-8a947b2499a1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"federated-petting-ripple"}
{"parentUuid":"dbef4d81-c667-4f11-9d8e-294b571fb0f6","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"55e0a9c9-5e46-447d-bd51-556d6261cceb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Tjio3QoJqKWywP9zLTSWGd","type":"tool_result","content":"\"OK\"\n\"OK\"\nok","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"51e7923a-58d9-4f27-8309-d19dd3f0c940","timestamp":"2026-10-10T20:36:04.583Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"\"OK\"\n\"OK\"\nok","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026/docs/architecture/07-pm-workflow.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":60,"oldLines":7,"newStart":60,"newLines":7,"lines":["     tabA[\"Tab · Analytics<br/>launch social test · 14-day engagement per profile<br/>reach · engagement · positive · momentum\"]","   end"," ","-  tabP --> page[\"Profile page (catalogue style, like BMW's option list)<br/>cover · at a glance · requirements matrix ■ □ vs other profiles<br/>KPIs · requirements in your priority order + draft targets + options<br/>why the agent chose it · L1 principles · competitors &amp; trends<br/>decision trail incl. reject reasons\"]","+  tabP --> page[\"Profile page (catalogue style, like BMW's option list)<br/>cover · at a glance · requirements matrix ■ □ vs other profiles<br/>ⓘ trace per requirement: feedback → competitors/trends → decision (who · when · why) → profile<br/>KPIs · requirements in your priority order + draft targets + options<br/>why the agent chose it · L1 principles · competitors &amp; trends<br/>decision trail incl. reject reasons\"]","   mem --> page","   page --> pdf[\"Download PDF<br/>A4 profile report\"]"," "]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026/docs/architecture/07-pm-workflow.md"]}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"dbef4d81-c667-4f11-9d8e-294b571fb0f6","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"53e0d48f-0e86-4176-8390-7