{"parentUuid":"57965577-e7dc-497b-b2c2-7fb01a0a8ce0","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14964419 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"e296863b-8202-445a-9572-933dc3d1d0a0","timestamp":"2026-10-10T21:04:36.550Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14964419 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"53e0d48f-0e86-4176-8390-70cad3fe3f46","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026","sessionId":"7fd52f13-5d0c-4e7f-8ec6-8a947b2499a1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"federated-petting-ripple"}
{"parentUuid":"e296863b-8202-445a-9572-933dc3d1d0a0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuEbaBZh7yk269BBfziQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Managers can now set the weights by writing an instruction on the Settings page: the AI proposes the settings and nothing changes until they apply them. I tested it end to end in a browser with your OpenAI key. Types and lint pass, and the two changed diagrams render without errors.\n\n**How it works** (sliders icon in the top bar → `/dashboard/settings`):\n- **Write the rule:** a \"Tell Dixi in your words\" box sits above the sliders, with four example instructions you can click.\n- **Suggest settings:** the AI returns a short summary, a **Now → Proposed** table for each changed setting, and one sentence per change explaining why.\n- **Apply or Discard:** Apply moves the sliders and the live example updates immediately.\n- **Change log:** every applied change records the instruction, the person and role, the date and time, and whether the AI or the simple fallback proposed it.\n\n**What the test showed:** \"For the 7 Series, past rejects should count for two years and hardly ever come back\" produced:\n- **Reject penalty:** 60% → 100%\n- **Memory:** 365 → 730 days\n- **Resurface threshold:** +30% → +150%\n\nAfter Apply, a request \"rejected today\" scores 0 in the example instead of 33. My test browser now has these settings, while yours still has the defaults.\n\n**Safety and limits:**\n- **Key on the server only:** the key is never sent to the browser; it's read from your git-ignored `.env`.\n- **Limited answers:** the model can only answer in a fixed format, and every value is clamped to its allowed range.\n- **Speed:** a request takes about 6–7 seconds; the first call after a restart took 30 seconds.\n- **Without a key** (the public Vercel site has none): a simple keyword fallback still proposes changes and is labelled as such.\n- **Settings are global:** they apply to **every** series and market. The AI now says so when an instruction names a single series. Per-series settings would be the natural next step.\n\n**Architecture docs:**\n- **`09-scoring-and-memory.md`:** a new \"Tell Dixi in your words\" section with the five steps, the flow added to the diagram, and the backend plan (tables for settings and for the change log).\n- **`06-web-app.md`:** the Settings page and the new server route.\n- **`docs/README.md` and `docs/requirements.md`:** mention plain-words settings and the server-only key.\n- **`web/.env.example`:** now lists the server-only `OPENAI_API_KEY` and model name. For the live site, the key would go into Vercel's settings, and I'll only do that if you ask.\n\nStill open: **three markets (Europe, China, USA), or the UK instead of Japan?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":570,"cache_read_input_tokens":653155,"output_tokens":881,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":570,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":881,"cache_read_input_tokens":653155,"cache_creation_input_tokens":570,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":570},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfuEbZe5KJG5yoFLfTZqP","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b7ab2528-a679-48a5-af13-20b602fe0e16","timestamp":"2026-10-10T21:04:45.460Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"53e0d48f-0e86-4176-8390-70cad3fe3f46","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/h