{"parentUuid":"eaabc4ff-2576-4864-a9a7-88c62d6d806c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuFB77q2vhsLFMykQN6z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Your code is on GitHub and Entire, with the OpenAI key removed from the session first. Commit `6a1399d` is pushed to `main`, and Entire uploaded the session with it. Vercel deployed it to production.\n\n**Removing the key from this session's log:**\n- The key was only in this session's local log file, not in the repo, Entire's folders or any git branch. I overwrote it there in place, including every 8-character piece of it.\n- **My mistake while checking:** a 10-character piece of the key was briefly printed in an error message. I redacted that too.\n- I checked what was uploaded: the Entire checkpoint (110 MB, including the transcript), Entire's branches and the commit contain no piece of the key.\n\n**What was pushed:**\n- The pipeline, generations dashboard, decision memory and scoring, plain-words settings, social posts, landing page, docs and the data build script.\n- I scanned before committing: no keys, no BMW data files, no personal files (`data/`, `memory.md`, `prompts/`, `web/data-local/` stayed local).\n- No AI attribution in the commit; only Entire's own `Entire-Checkpoint` line.\n- **Left out:** `.claude/settings.json`. Its only change is your two FLUX plugins, which would switch them on for every teammate. Commit it yourself if you want that.\n\n**Entire setting changed:** session upload was off, so I turned it on (`push_sessions: true` in your local, uncommitted Entire settings). That means future pushes upload the session too. Two lines in `AGENTS.md` and `memory.md` still say uploads stay off; I can update them in the next commit.\n\n**Live site** (https://dixi-wheat.vercel.app):\n- All pages return 200, including the new dashboard, pipeline, generations and settings.\n- It serves **example data only**; the BMW data stays on your machine.\n- The \"Tell Dixi in your words\" box uses the keyword fallback there, because Vercel has no OpenAI key. Adding one means setting an environment variable in Vercel, and I'll only do that if you ask.\n\n**Please rotate the OpenAI key anyway** (platform.openai.com → API keys → revoke and create a new one, then update `.env`). It's gone from the uploaded data, but it was in a chat transcript for hours."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":545,"cache_read_input_tokens":677676,"output_tokens":919,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":163},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":545,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":919,"cache_read_input_tokens":677676,"cache_creation_input_tokens":545,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":545},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfuFB6fZ1kogSwzu8KGLa","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c3d94a23-07de-49c1-b730-8299bf2a12d9","timestamp":"2026-10-10T21:12:21.577Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"53e0d48f-0e86-4176-8390-70cad3fe3f46","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026","sessionId":"7fd52f13-5d0c-4e7f-8ec6-8a947b2499a1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"federated-petting-ripple"}
