{"parentUuid":"f110915f-acbc-44ae-b190-e0baadf86024","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuKFAZmngrGMvM3W9N8w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014YXqxQrKEe8QuDF8LHWRh7","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"entire trail create --title \"Dixi MVP: requirement pipeline, generations and decision memory\" --type feature --priority high --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nHackathon MVP for the BMW challenge \"AI for Product Decision Making\" (EHL Munich 2026). Commit 6a1399d on main.\n\nWhat it covers\n- Pipeline /dashboard/[market]/[series]: AI analysis (BMW principles → market evidence incl. research agent for competitors and trends → feature requests by category and urgency)\n- PM decisions: keep, reject with required reason, drag priority, wishlist; every decision records who, role, when and customer count\n- Build → generation: 3 profiles (catalogue-style page, PDF export, per-requirement trace), analytics with social posts (L3 social test, simulated)\n- Dashboard: generations list, new analysis, local \"who is deciding\" identity\n- Dixi score with decision memory (past rejects ranked lower with a half-life, resurface when demand grows) and settings, incl. natural-language proposals via /api/scoring-advice\n- Landing page for the workflow, licensed car photos; docs/architecture 01–09\n\nOpen\n- Markets: Europe/China/USA only, or UK instead of Japan?\n- Backend (FastAPI + Supabase) to replace localStorage; agent tool get_decision_memory\n- Real social channel for the L3 test; per-series scoring settings\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -15","description":"Create Entire trail for main","timeout":120000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":616,"cache_read_input_tokens":679699,"output_tokens":711,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":50},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"