{"parentUuid":"c3e80182-d255-4c22-a1d5-f44be9c8b0f5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuKLiVnZBFbhiKHLscpT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I created the trail on Entire: **https://entire.io/gh/peresramirez/Dixi/trails/1**. It isn't attached to a branch, though; that was the only version Entire accepted.\n\n- **Title:** \"Dixi MVP: requirement pipeline, generations and decision memory\"\n- **Settings:** type feature, priority high, status open\n- **Description:** what commit `6a1399d` delivers and what's still open (markets, backend + Supabase, a real social channel).\n\n**Why it isn't on `main`:** a trail needs a branch with commits ahead of its base. All the work is already on `main` (the default branch), so there was nothing to compare.\n\n**Leftover branch to clean up:** Entire's first two attempts created and pushed a branch `dixi-mvp-requirement-pipeline-generations-and-decision-memory`. It points at the same commit as `main`, so it adds nothing. I'd like to delete it locally and on GitHub; say yes and I will.\n\n**For the next trails:** start each piece of work on its own branch (for example `git switch -c markets-uk`). Then a trail can follow that branch's commits, checkpoints and reviews until you merge it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1026,"cache_read_input_tokens":682977,"output_tokens":492,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":106},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1026,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":492,"cache_read_input_tokens":682977,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1026,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1026},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard",