{"parentUuid":"331c1361-09ac-4f59-aaf6-33cf408de50b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"1f305739-b3be-4074-bd02-08686123db3e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014nRtiQdmB4HtP4KmpDZhu4","type":"tool_result","content":"entire dispatch — Generate a dispatch summarizing recent agent work\nGenerate a dispatch summarizing recent agent work.\n\nExamples:\n  entire dispatch\n  entire dispatch --local --all-branches\n  entire dispatch --local --agent codex\n  entire dispatch --repos entireio/cli\n  entire dispatch --repos entirehq/ferrata --jurisdiction us\n  entire dispatch --voice neutral\n\nA cloud dispatch covers repos placed in exactly one jurisdiction and is\ngenerated by that jurisdiction's cell. Without --jurisdiction it\nuses your home jurisdiction (see 'entire auth status'); a repo mirrored only\nelsewhere is reported as not found there, so pass --jurisdiction <slug> to\ntarget the jurisdiction the repo is placed in.\n\nCurrent repo: gh/peresramirez/Dixi  (auto-detected from origin; pass --repo only for a DIFFERENT repo)\n\nFlags:\n      --agent string          local text-generation agent (requires --local)\n      --all-branches          include every existing local branch (--local only; renamed or deleted branches are skipped)\n  -j, --jurisdiction string   jurisdiction slug (e.g. us, eu) whose cell generates the cloud dispatch; defaults to your home jurisdiction\n      --local                 generate via the locally-installed agent CLI instead of the Entire server\n      --repos strings         cloud repo slugs, up to 5 (for example entireio/cli)\n-----\n.entire/.gitignore\n.entire/runners/trail-confidence.json\n.entire/runners/trail-drift.json\n.entire/runners/trail-review.json\n.entire/runners/trail-risk.json\n.entire/runners/trail-security.json\n.entire/runners/trail-summary.json\n.entire/settings.json","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ea34e9e4-e207-4117-ada2-19099e9d55cf","timestamp":"2026-10-10T22:15:05.840Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"entire dispatch — Generate a dispatch summarizing recent agent work\nGenerate a dispatch summarizing recent agent work.\n\nExamples:\n  entire dispatch\n  entire dispatch --local --all-branches\n  entire dispatch --local --agent codex\n  entire dispatch --repos entireio/cli\n  entire dispatch --repos entirehq/ferrata --jurisdiction us\n  entire dispatch --voice neutral\n\nA cloud dispatch covers repos placed in exactly one jurisdiction and is\ngenerated by that jurisdiction's cell. Without --jurisdiction it\nuses your home jurisdiction (see 'entire auth status'); a repo mirrored only\nelsewhere is reported as not found there, so pass --jurisdiction <slug> to\ntarget the jurisdiction the repo is placed in.\n\nCurrent repo: gh/peresramirez/Dixi  (auto-detected from origin; pass --repo only for a DIFFERENT repo)\n\nFlags:\n      --agent string          local text-generation agent (requires --local)\n      --all-branches          include every existing local branch (--local only; renamed or deleted branches are skipped)\n  -j, --jurisdiction string   jurisdiction slug (e.g. us, eu) whose cell generates the cloud dispatch; defaults to your home jurisdiction\n      --local                 generate via the locally-installed agent CLI instead of the Entire server\n      --repos strings         cloud repo slugs, up to 5 (for example entireio/cli)\n-----\n.entire/.gitignore\n.entire/runners/trail-confidence.json\n.entire/runners/trail-drift.json\n.entire/runners/trail-review.json\n.entire/runners/trail-risk.json\n.entire/runners/trail-security.json\n.entire/runners/trail-summary.json\n.entire/settings.json","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"331c1361-09ac-4f59-aaf6-33cf408de50b","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"53e0d48f-0e86-4176-8390-70cad3fe3f46","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-min