{"parentUuid":"a5ef0cb1-ddfe-4d79-8778-23d2ed8ebb0e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuKzWVHjNBnWDwdJ1vKC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":873,"cache_read_input_tokens":694664,"output_tokens":693,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":55},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":873,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":693,"cache_read_input_tokens":694664,"cache_creation_input_tokens":873,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":873},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":6816,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfuKzVzHBfEPktnporHiq","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b8b4c709-f62f-47bb-8db1-b04edc367f6b","timestamp":"2026-10-10T22:15:29.951Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"53e0d48f-0e86-4176-8390-70cad3fe3f46","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026","sessionId":"7fd52f13-5d0c-4e7f-8ec6-8a947b2499a1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"federated-petting-ripple"}
{"parentUuid":"b8b4c709-f62f-47bb-8db1-b04edc367f6b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuKzWVHjNBnWDwdJ1vKC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You don't see runners because there's nothing for them to review yet. This is what I found:\n\n**1. The trail has no branch, so there's no push to evaluate.**\n- `entire trail show 1` reports: branch *(empty)*, base `main`, phase **planning**.\n- Runners start **when a trail branch is pushed** (with \"Auto build on push\" on). They review that branch's diff against its base.\n- A branchless trail is the idea stage, so no runner fires.\n\n**2. The branch Entire pushed earlier has no changes either.** `dixi-mvp-…` points at the same commit as `main`, so its diff is empty. That's also why Entire rejected the trail for it (the 422 error).\n\n**3. The runner setup itself is fine.** All 6 runner files are on GitHub `main` in `.entire/runners/`, where Entire reads them from.\n\n**4. One thing I can't check from here:** whether **Runners** and **Auto build on push** are switched on in entire.io under Settings → General. If either is off, runners won't run even on a real trail branch.\n\n**Also:** the trail's description is empty, even though I passed one, and the CLI can only update trails that have a branch. If you want the description on trail 1, paste it in on entire.io.\n\n**How to see the runners work:** make one trail with a real, small change on its own branch. A good candidate is a change that's due anyway: update `AGENTS.md` and `docs/requirements.md`, which still say session upload stays off.\n1. `entire trail create --title \"Docs: session upload is on\" --checkout`: trail plus new branch.\n2. Edit the two files, commit, push.\n3. On entire.io, the trail shows Summary, Review findings and the Risk / Confidence / Security / Drift scores within a few minutes.\n4. You Approve and Merge there, and Vercel redeploys `main`.\n\nWant me to do that? I'd also delete the empty `dixi-mvp-…` branch while I'm at it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":873,"cache_read_input_tokens":694664,"output_tokens":693,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":55},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":873,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":693,"cache_read_input_tokens":694664,"cache_creation_input_tokens":873,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":873},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfuKzVzHBfEPktnporHiq","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8c162264-2b91-45aa-97a7-64814e7065bc","timestamp":"2026-10-10T22:15:29.979Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"53e0d48f-0e86-4176-8390-70cad3fe3f46","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026","sessionId":"7fd52f13-5d0c-4e7f-8ec6-8a947b2499a1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"federated-petting-ripple"}
