{"parentUuid":"b6990381-551c-4a6c-9112-4d564f7b592e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuLd9HN3fADKnjiyjZ4F","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014QVSp11MjACYh9SP4Kupcx","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"gh pr create --base main --head agents-consult-entire --title \"Agents consult Entire for past intent; work in trails\" --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'\n## Why\nAgents should not guess about code or past decisions, and work should not land straight on `main`, or the intent behind it gets lost.\n\n## What\n- **AGENTS.md §5:** \"Ask Entire first\". For any question about code, intent or past decisions, agents use `entire why`, `entire search`, `entire checkpoint explain` and `entire trail show`, and quote what they found.\n- **Trail workflow:** one intent, one trail, one branch, small commits. Push, then the runners review it. Approve and merge on the trail with a merge commit, so the `Entire-Checkpoint` links survive.\n- **Session upload is on:** never paste secrets; redact before pushing.\n- **docs/requirements.md:** the matching daily commands.\n\nDocs only, no code change.\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -2; sleep 5; entire trail create --branch agents-consult-entire --title \"Agents consult Entire for past intent; work in trails\" --type task 2>&1 | tail -3","description":"Open PR with gh, then retry trail create","timeout":180000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":767,"cache_read_input_tokens":708462,"output_tokens":746,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":224},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":767,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":746,"cache_read_input_tokens":708462,"cache_creation_input_tok