{"parentUuid":"1c0f6139-8e34-4451-95da-60ca2a137636","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfuLfZHJFqPJhWYU32fQx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The trail with a branch still fails with 422, even with PR #1 open. Here's where things stand:\n\n| Step | Status |\n|---|---|\n| Branch `agents-consult-entire` | ✓ Created and pushed (2 commits ahead of `main`) |\n| `AGENTS.md` | ✓ New \"Ask Entire first\" rules and the one-intent-per-trail workflow; session upload is now noted as on |\n| `docs/requirements.md` | ✓ Matching daily commands (trail workflow, `entire why` / `search`) |\n| Transcript check before pushing | ✓ 0 key fragments |\n| GitHub PR | ✓ https://github.com/peresramirez/Dixi/pull/1 |\n| Trail for the branch | ✗ Entire's server answers \"validation failed (422)\" every time |\n| Runners | Not started: they only run on a trail with a branch |\n| Merge | Not done yet |\n\n**What I've ruled out:** the branch has real commits (GitHub shows 2 ahead), a PR exists, and `entire doctor` reports the local setup as healthy. Branchless trails work; only trails with a branch are rejected, and the CLI doesn't say why. Probable cause: a setting on entire.io, for example Trails or Runners not fully enabled for this repo, or the GitHub App missing pull-request access. That's my inference; I can't see the settings from here.\n\n**Suggested next step (2 minutes on entire.io):**\n1. Open https://entire.io/gh/peresramirez/Dixi → **Settings → General** and check that **Runners**, **Trails** and **Auto build on push** are on.\n2. **Trails → New Trail** → choose **link an existing branch** → `agents-consult-entire`. If something is wrong, the website should show the actual error message instead of \"422\".\n3. Once the trail exists, the runners review the two commits and you can approve and merge there.\n\n**Merge question:** you asked me to merge. I can merge PR #1 right away on GitHub, with a merge commit so the checkpoint links survive, but then this change never goes through a trail or the runners. Or I wait until you've linked the trail on entire.io and merge after the review. Which do you prefer?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":864,"cache_read_input_tokens":709229,"output_tokens":1036,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":306},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":864,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1036,"cache_read_input_tokens":709229,"cache_creation_input_tokens":864,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":864},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfuLfYonXaShy1Vg4bCXG","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"bdb15d10-1f6d-4b1c-bee9-419019d82657","timestamp":"2026-10-10T22:24:22.857Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"53e0d48f-0e86-4176-8390-70cad3fe3f46","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/PJ/peresjav/hackathons/ehl-final-minuch-2026","sessionId":"7fd52f13-5d0c-4e7f-8ec6-8a947b2499a1","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"agents-consult-entire","slug":"federated-petting-ripple"}
